# NOTE (Phase 0, 2026-07-27): `*.snap` was previously ignored here, which meant
# 61 of 68 Jest snapshots were never committed. Snapshots are a visual-
# regression baseline — unversioned, they cannot detect drift and the
# "84 snapshots committed" claim in the sprint reports was not true.
# They are now tracked.

